Scoped colorize solid HSL colour overlay

The option table, the pixel_fmts negotiation list, the float hsl2rgb and
hue2rgb helpers, the double rgb2yuv helper with C truncation, the eight-bit
luma lerp of colorizey_slice8 and the chroma fill of colorize_slice8 in
src/video-ops/colorize.ts follow libavfilter/vf_colorize.c (lerpf,
colorizey_slice8, colorize_slice8, hue2rgb, hsl2rgb, rgb2yuv, filter_frame,
config_input, colorize_options, pixel_fmts).
